  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal Displacement Monitoring Centre 2022-25</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Internal Displacement Monitoring Centre (IDMC) is the leading source of credible data and information on internally displaced persons worldwide, and plays a unique global advocacy role in raising awareness of the rights and plight of internally displaced people. Funding under this proposal provides support to IDMC to expand its research base with new partners and strengthen knowledge on the structural drivers, patterns and impacts of internal displacement. This will allow IDMC to continue producing information and analysis on global internal displacement and inform and influence international and national efforts to fulfil the rights of internally displaced persons in line with international standards. The total estimated value of this investment is $1,700,000.</narrative>
  </description>
